---
description: expo-demo repo rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md at the repo root. It is the source of truth.

Non-negotiable:
- Auth path is Convex Auth, and it is not set up yet. Never install Better Auth, Clerk, or WorkOS.
- User LLM API keys stay in expo-secure-store on device. Never persist or log them.
- Convex queries are reactive. No polling code.
- Check https://www.convex.dev/components before hand-building backend infrastructure.
- Import backend types from @expo-demo/backend; never duplicate them.
